        <section class="language-section english-section" lang="en" dir="ltr">
            <h1>Experience the Spirit of Ramadan with Every Sip</h1>

            <p>This Ramadan, elevate your late-night gatherings with the Qahwa Lab Ramadan Blend. Crafted for those quiet, reflective moments and the lively suhoor sessions, our signature blend captures the essence of the season.</p>

            <div class="offer-box">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">The Ramadan Offer</h3>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Enjoy <strong>20% off</strong> our exclusive Ramadan Blend throughout the holy month.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-box">
                <h3 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Free Delivery</h3>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Order your coffee after Iftar, and we will deliver it to your doorstep for <strong>free</strong>. Whether you are preparing for a long night or starting your day with a perfect brew, we are here to bring the cafe experience to you.</p>
            </div>

            <a href="#" class="cta-button">Shop the Ramadan Blend</a>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Qahwa Lab. All rights reserved. | جميع الحقوق محفوظة لـ قهوة لاب.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
